      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm puttin together some training modules for our new boutique staff. We want to get them ready for all kinds of customers so they aren't caught off guard. Can you help me brainstorm some different types of \"challenging\" or \"difficult\" customer profiles they might run into? Like, can you describe a few different personas that might require extra attention or a specific way of handling them so the staff knows what to look out for?",
