      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"sassy latina\" one is interesting. what specifically should the staff be looking for with that profile? like, in terms of body language or how they carry themselves, are there any particular signs that they might become a \"difficult\" customer so the team can be prepared to de-escalate?",
